  "hook": {
    "lines": [
      "This phone screen is made of *glass*…",
      "and it folds in half."
    ],
    "clip": "f_unfold",
    "annotate": [
      {
        "type": "arrow",
        "at": 0,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5,
        "angle": 30
      }
    ],
    "sfx": [
      {
        "id": "boom",
        "at": "word:folds"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "lines": [
        "It's Samsung's new",
        "*Galaxy Z Fold8 Ultra*."
      ],
      "clip": "f_product"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "But glass doesn't bend…",
        "so how?"
      ],
      "clip": "f_fold_hand",
      "punch": true
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Samsung shaves it into *ultra-thin glass* —",
        "thinner than a human hair."
      ],
      "clip": "f_edge"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "At that thickness,",
        "glass can actually *flex*."
      ],
      "clip": "f_fold_hand2"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Underneath sits a layer of *titanium*",
        "that spreads out the stress,"
      ],
      "clip": "f_ui",
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "ding",
          "at": "word:titanium"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "so the fold stays *smooth*."
      ],
      "clip": "f_ui2"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Unfolded, the whole phone",
        "is just *4.1 millimeters* thin."
      ],
      "clip": "f_slim"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Samsung says the crease",
        "is less visible than *ever*."
      ],
      "clip": "f_compare"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "But here's the *twist*…"
      ],
      "clip": "f_grass",
      "pause_after": 0.3,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "dun_dun",
          "at": "start",
          "gain": -5,
          "dur": 2.2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "After one week of use,",
        "a reviewer said the crease *came back*."
      ],
      "clip": "f_grass2",
      "punch": true,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "boom",
          "at": "word:came"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Especially in *bright light*."
      ],
      "clip": "f_sun"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Would *you* pay over $2,000 for this?"
      ],
      "clip": "f_man"
    }
  ],
